@startuml C2SBridge_stockDemo
title Stock Token Bridging to Solana - Demo Sequence

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

box "Stock CorDapp Parties" #LightPink
actor "WayneCo\n(Stock Issuer)" as WayneCo
actor "Shareholder\n(Token Holder)" as Shareholder
participant "Observer" as Observer
end box

box "Corda Bridge Infrastructure" #LightGreen
participant "Bridge Authority\n<Corda Node>" as BA
participant "Locking Identity\n(Confidential)" as LockID
participant "General Notary" as GN
participant "Solana Notary\n<Corda Node>" as SN
end box

box "Solana Network" #LightBlue
participant "Solana Network" as SOL
end box

== Phase 0: Stock Issuance and Distribution ==
autonumber "<b>(S##)"

WayneCo -> WayneCo: IssueStock(TEST, 500 shares)
WayneCo -> GN: Notarize issuance
GN --> WayneCo: Confirmed
WayneCo -> Observer: Notify stock creation

WayneCo -> Shareholder: MoveStock(TEST, 100 shares)
WayneCo -> GN: Notarize transfer
GN --> Shareholder: Confirmed

note over Shareholder: Shareholder now owns\n100 TEST shares on Corda

== Phase 1: Initiate Bridging ==
autonumber "<b>(B##)"

Shareholder -> BA: MoveStock(TEST, 60 shares)\nTransfer to Bridge Authority

note right of BA: Bridge Authority receives\nstock tokens to bridge

== Phase 2: Lock Phase ==
BA -> BA: Lookup/create Locking Identity\n(confidential identity)
BA -> LockID: Move tokens to locking identity
BA -> BA: Create BridgedFungibleTokenProxy\n(contains Solana mint metadata)\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-solana-toolkit/blob/main/bridging-token-contracts/src/main/kotlin/com/r3/corda/lib/solana/bridging/token/states/BridgedFungibleTokenProxy.kt BridgedFungibleTokenProxy]]
BA -> GN: FinalityFlow (Lock transaction)
GN --> BA: Notarized

note over LockID: Tokens locked in escrow\nProxy state created

== Phase 3: Notary Change ==
BA -> GN: NotaryChangeFlow\n(Proxy: General → Solana Notary)
GN --> BA: Notary changed

== Phase 4: Mint on Solana ==
BA -> SN: FinalityFlow + Token2022.mintTo instruction\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-solana-toolkit/blob/main/bridging-token-contracts/src/main/kotlin/com/r3/corda/lib/solana/bridging/token/contracts/FungibleTokenBridgeContract.kt FungibleTokenBridgeContract.MintToSolana]]
SN -> SN: Build Solana TX\n(commit + mintTo)
SN -> SN: Sign with mint authority key
SN -> SOL: Submit Solana transaction
SOL --> SN: Transaction confirmed
SN --> BA: Notarized + Solana confirmation

note over SOL: SPL tokens minted to\nShareholder's Solana wallet

BA -> Shareholder: Notify bridging complete
SOL -> Shareholder: Tokens visible in wallet

== Phase 5: (Optional) Solana Token Transfer ==
autonumber "<b>(T##)"

Shareholder -> SOL: Transfer/Swap SPL tokens\n(e.g., for USDC)

note over SOL: Tokens now held by\nnew Solana party

== Phase 6: Redemption (Solana → Corda) ==
autonumber "<b>(R##)"

SOL -> BA: WebSocket: Balance detected\non redemption address
note right of BA: [[https://github.com/corda/corda-solana-toolkit/blob/main/bridging-token-workflows/src/main/kotlin/com/r3/corda/lib/solana/bridging/token/flows/BridgingService.kt BridgingService]]
BA -> BA: Query vault for\nmatching locked tokens
BA -> SN: BurnTokensOnSolanaFlow\n+ Token2022.burn instruction\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-solana-toolkit/blob/main/bridging-token-contracts/src/main/kotlin/com/r3/corda/lib/solana/bridging/token/contracts/FungibleTokenRedemptionContract.kt FungibleTokenRedemptionContract.BurnOnSolana]]
SN -> SOL: Submit burn transaction
SOL --> SN: Burn confirmed
SN --> BA: FungibleTokenBurnReceipt issued\n[[https://github.com/corda/corda-solana-toolkit/blob/main/bridging-token-contracts/src/main/kotlin/com/r3/corda/lib/solana/bridging/token/states/FungibleTokenBurnReceipt.kt FungibleTokenBurnReceipt]]

BA -> GN: NotaryChangeFlow\n(Receipt: Solana → General Notary)
GN --> BA: Notary changed

BA -> LockID: Unlock tokens
BA -> Shareholder: Transfer redeemed tokens
BA -> GN: FinalityFlow
GN --> Shareholder: Tokens received

note over Shareholder: Original Corda tokens\nreturned to holder

@enduml
